OL,6,FEzra Collective, Nia Archives and Busta
OL,7,FRhymes are also on the bill, with Peggy
OL,8,FGou joining Amelie Lens and Sara Landry
OL,9,Fon the club line-up, and Sammy Virji   
OL,10,Famong the UK garage acts.              
